From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Koen Kooi <koen@dominion.thruhere.net>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 09:26:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rust-target-config: only request +thumb-mode alongside
 +thumb2

llvm_features_from_tune() adds "+thumb-mode" for any tune with "thumb"
in TUNE_FEATURES and ARM_THUMB_OPT == "thumb", regardless of whether
the tune actually has Thumb-2 (+thumb2, gated on target_is_armv7()).
For a Thumb-1-only tune (armv5t/armv5te: TUNE_FEATURES has "thumb" but
never "armv7*"), this produces "+v5t,+thumb-mode" without "+thumb2" --
a combination LLVM's ARM backend does not support for whole-crate
default-Thumb codegen. compiler_builtins ships inline asm that
requires Thumb-2 for this, and fails even with a now-valid +v5t
feature (see the previous patch in this series):

    error: <inline asm>:5:1: target does not support Thumb mode
    error: could not compile `compiler_builtins` (lib)

rustc's own upstream armv5te-unknown-linux-gnueabi target confirms
this is expected: it never sets "+thumb-mode" at all and compiles in
ARM mode (relying on standard ARM/Thumb interworking, which v5TE's
BLX instruction provides for calls into e.g. glibc's Thumb-mode
code). Every real rustc target that does set "+thumb-mode" also
carries "+thumb2"/"+v7" -- there is no upstream target combining
"+thumb-mode" with a pre-v7 architecture feature.

Move the "+thumb-mode" append inside the target_is_armv7() branch so
it is only ever requested together with +thumb2, matching upstream
target definitions. Pre-v7 Thumb-capable tunes (armv5t, armv5te,
armv6-novfp, ...) now compile Rust in ARM mode, same as their real
rustc target counterparts.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Koen Kooi <koen@dominion.thruhere.net>
---
 meta/classes-recipe/rust-target-config.bbclass | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meta/classes-recipe/rust-target-config.bbclass b/meta/classes-recipe/rust-target-config.bbclass
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/meta/classes-recipe/rust-target-config.bbclass
+++ b/meta/classes-recipe/rust-target-config.bbclass
@@ -63,11 +63,13 @@ def llvm_features_from_tune(d):
     if 'dsp' in feat:
         f.append("+dsp")

     if 'thumb' in feat:
         if d.getVar('ARM_THUMB_OPT') == "thumb":
+            # LLVM only supports whole-crate Thumb-mode codegen (needed
+            # by compiler_builtins' inline asm) with Thumb-2 available.
             if target_is_armv7(d):
                 f.append('+thumb2')
-            f.append("+thumb-mode")
+                f.append("+thumb-mode")

     if 'cortexa5' in feat:
         f.append("+a5")
--
2.43.0
